 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6z03FQIyQQgQ7kNvwEc6IgC&_nc_oc=AdqK5Nv0avg3hwPTf60P9d3Raji9NHIK4NvPasCFGd9_zTbrdX40fsj96e0mLh2Mg-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIRrXCX5fU2XGJg4rUfz2kXBeZvtZYNlC_d0R61mgYSVQ&oe=6A9C32C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OmUVDx091Y8Q7kNvwFx5A6G&_nc_oc=AdoG9jJKd2XjYB1bfgCdY0plmOsfdJq81IoyZ7fYmzl540KhsLyGil6L65ouqwVdrGI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIVIWCaqv5Ab-Cb0eWaPJpedEQBNx8O05_iN_srTKZ26g&oe=6A9C4026"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LSBD4gZAqXwQ7kNvwGvdPke&_nc_oc=AdooPCnuVuJ5AK3rkKnTwJX3RQ-CxwwxnktXbQLQtihf2Y3SzBK3qbGS1LV0C5xG0FI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKjCmvvuYnPpjg70Ba30IBe222siAfNE4VhvWFAqDs96Q&oe=6A9C11DC"}, {"fil